#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.0.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: May 1, 2020"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:6
msgid "**4.0.3 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:12
msgid ""
"Thanks to the community, there have been 74 bugs closed, 21 issues "
"closed, and 88 merged pull requests. These are all listed in the "
"`CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_."
" This is a small representation of some of the bigger changes you should "
"know about."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:17
msgid "Enhancements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:19
msgid ""
"The API Response Trait now only determines the final formatting "
"(json/xml) through content negotiation when the controller's ``$format`` "
"variable is ``null``. If it contains either ``json`` or ``xml``, then "
"that format will always be returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:20
msgid ""
"Pagination now can actually create next page and previous page links, "
"instead of next/previous groups of links."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:21
msgid ""
"Windows users wanting to build their own copy of the user guide locally "
"can now use the included ``make.bat`` file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:22
msgid ""
"Locale matching in the IncomingRequest class now works to match broad "
"groups, like ``fr`` even when the browser only supplies a more specific "
"locale code, like ``fr-FR``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:23
msgid "Added the ability to have nested language defintions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"add ability to replace {locale} to request->getLocale() in "
"form_open('action')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:25
msgid "tables generated by CLI commands can now be colored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:28
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:30
msgid "Deleting through the Model on a table with string primary key now works."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:31
msgid "Default pagination templates fixed to use the correct locale."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:32
msgid "Lots of tweaks and corrections in the user guide."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:33
msgid ""
"Fixed locating files in custom namespaces that were occassionally not "
"found. Primarily affected console commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.3.rst:35
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.0.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.0.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""

